sentences.t:
cum tamen omnis
ferre iuvat subter densa testudine casus;
nec iam sufficiunt.

sentences.l:
when nevertheless all
to bear it pleases, beneath the dense tortoise, falls;
nor now do they hold out.

sentences.t:
Vos, o Calliope, precor, adspirate canenti,
quas ibi tum ferro strages, quae funera Turnus
ediderit, quem quisque virum demiserit Orco;

sentences.l:
You, O Calliope, I pray, breathe upon me singing,
what there then with the sword slaughters, what deaths Turnus
brought about, what man each sent down to Orcus;
